Package: chihaya
Title: HDF5 Bindings for Alabaster 
Description: 
    Low-level utilities for interacting with HDF5 files via C++ bindings to the Rhdf5lib package.
    This is intended to be used by the various alabaster.* packages, where it provides more control than the rhdf5 package.
Authors@R: person("Aaron", "Lun", role=c("cre", "aut"), email="infinite.monkeys.with.keyboards@gmail.com") 
